
Uhlelo ukuphathwa-kwenkumbulo: 1.
Uhlelo inkumbulo: 16000000.
>> tokens := ['{}↲.:,x() '].
{ :i
	>> ikhodi := [''].
	>> x := Inombolo phakathi: 1 no: 10.
	{
		>> y := Inombolo phakathi: 1 no: (tokens ubude).
		ikhodi engeza-ekugcineni: (tokens uhlamvu: y).
	} × x.
	{ Umsebenzi okusha: ikhodi. } bamba: { ['Empty']. }, qala.

} × 10000.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['OK'], umugqa-omusha.
